">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.490" end="00:31.900"><span begin="00:30.490" end="00:30.940">Lookin' </span><span begin="00:30.940" end="00:31.180">through </span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.270">a </span><span begin="00:31.270" end="00:31.900">screen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.900" end="00:33.820"><span begin="00:31.900" end="00:32.110">I'm </span><span begin="00:32.110" end="00:32.320">here </span><span begin="00:32.320" end="00:32.380">in </span><span begin="00:32.380" end="00:32.680">front </span><span begin="00:32.680" end="00:32.770">of </span><span begin="00:32.770" end="00:33.820">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.240" end="00:38.410"><span begin="00:34.240" end="00:35.140">Sometimes </span><span begin="00:35.140" end="00:35.260">the </span><span begin="00:35.260" end="00:35.830">days</span><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:35.830">, </span><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:35.950">they </span><span begin="00:35.950" end="00:36.430">feel </span><span begin="00:36.430" end="00:36.670">so </span><span begin="00:36.670" end="00:38.410">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.090" end="00:43.570"><span begin="00:40.090" end="00:40.330">We </span><span begin="00:40.330" end="00:40.630">all </span><span begin="00:40.630" end="00:41.050">live </span><span begin="00:41.050" end="00:41.680">under </span><span begin="00:41.680" end="00:41.890">the </span><span begin="00:41.890" end="00:42.670">same </span><span begin="00:42.670" end="00:43.570">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.040" end="00:48.460"><span begin="00:45.040" end="00:45.520">So </span><span begin="00:45.520" end="00:45.760">I </span><span begin="00:45.760" end="00:46.330">hit </span><span begin="00:46.330" end="00:46.660">my </span><span begin="00:46.660" end="00:47.080">head </span><span begin="00:47.080" end="00:47.290">up </span><span begin="00:47.290" end="00:47.800">against </span><span begin="00:47.800" end="00:47.920">the </span><span begin